  "implementation": {
    "root": "Hat and FtPartsDesc followed by sword joint at +12 and dynamics at +16. No projectile Articles. Only the two pinned unreachable exporter-wrapper pointers are omitted.",
    "attachment": "Original setupStartAccessory attaches the sword to right thumb. The browser accessory adapter requires its exact resident descriptor and selects the corresponding model. Native callbacks still control visibility and lifetime.",
    "charge": "Original C increments the charge counter and automatically releases when counter > charge_iterations * 30. Read-only diagnostics observe thresholds 120/210 and releases 121/211.",
    "coverage": "Partial ground and air release, full ground auto-release, recovery, copy loss/reacquisition, dynamic pool recovery, original collision and hitlag. Per-model telemetry observes actual sword submissions and rejects GPU resources retained after native removal."
  },
  "limits": [
    "Original C integration and internal GPU oracle, not retail per-frame parity.",
    "Full-charge airborne release, all attack spacings/interactions and all costume colors are not exhaustively tested.",
    "No presented-FPS or input-to-photon measurement; no new performance gain claimed.",
    "Full scenes, remaining abilities/costumes, menus/audio, retail parity, networking and public static deployment remain incomplete.",
    "Automatic hosted no-ISO startup unchanged; no game assets or binaries committed."
  ]
